Such great confidence, you’ve just found! Just found...

We can get by on a prayer. Ok.
But will we survive? Survive our own fate?  
Fortunate today, but not forever. Not, forever...

Close my eyes, and let it pass over. No surprises left in me. Rode the tide that left me sober.
Ran it to the ground, I lock and load. Lock and Load.
Lock and Load.

