5lq0qViCTvg,A-GON - Moon,HearWeGo,118,18742,125.0,2017-07-18,"From A-GON's SoundCloud channel:

""Oyeme Thomas, a musician best known as Swept, has recently undergone tragedy. Her mother, Jestina, has suffered a stroke resulting in paralysis. Their family is facing staggering medical bills and a very difficult future. Please help support them by either donating on GoFundMe or buying this album featuring atmospheric music from several different artists. We appreciate anything you can give.

http://www.gofundme.com/thomasfamilyneedshelp

http://www.foroyeme.bandcamp.com

The cool story about this track is that the chords I used on it were actually made by Oyeme a couple months ago, she had no ideas for them so I asked her if could try and do something with them and I did which is why I love this track so much, thank you Oyeme :)""

I always supported Swept and A-GON music on my channel.

Putting this song into my chill/ambient playlist, that gets more than 1000 view per day, is my way to support Oyeme (Swept) and also, all the revenues from this video will be donated so feel free to share the video and disable the Ad-blocker.

