I wake up in the night,
And I don't feel you. 
Have you lost your mind
In those shades of blue? 
You've drown your love
In the ocean's waves, 
And you still hope that 
I will miss you back. 

Another love,
Another lie to me,
Another fight with yourself, 
Another sleepless night, 
Another broken heart, 
Ooo baby, ooo baby. 

