00:00:20.873 --> 00:00:29.997
Stuck in the past

00:00:49.036 --> 00:00:55.035
I’m singing the song written with pains from the bottom of my heart.

00:00:55.868 --> 00:01:00.034
Because I think pains that I have were begun from the day you left.

00:01:00.243 --> 00:01:08.033
You don’t know the taste of tears but I exactly know how is it.
I know every mistake must be paid for.

00:01:08.242 --> 00:01:13.241
After all, I hope that I don’t remember you anymore.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:20.032
When the rain comes heavily, I miss you more.

00:01:20.691 --> 00:01:27.031
I try to raise my hand to catch the raindrops
But I can no longer distinguish between raindrops and tears.

00:01:27.239 --> 00:01:34.030
Suddenly I remember the sad story between me and you at that time.

00:01:34.238 --> 00:01:40.029
Now I just wish that the rain would stop a little so I don't suffer anymore.

00:01:41.029 --> 00:01:47.028
In the dark I quietly let time pass.

00:01:47.861 --> 00:01:54.027
I know our love has gone.
After everything I feel confused and doubtful about our story.

00:01:55.027 --> 00:02:02.026
The rain outside is still falling at the moment.
Because of the nostalgic rain, I remember that I held you happily in this room.

00:02:02.235 --> 00:02:08.026
The room where all our beautiful memories are kept.

00:02:08.026 --> 00:02:14.025
I feel like a boat floating aimlessly.

00:02:14.025 --> 00:02:20.024
The ocean waves push me to shore then I just look up at the sky and imagine.

00:02:20.857 --> 00:02:24.023
I feel like an unwelcome guest in your life.

00:02:24.232 --> 00:02:28.023
Maybe I'm bothering you.

00:02:28.856 --> 00:02:31.856
Can we go back to the day we never knew each other?

00:02:31.856 --> 00:02:34.855
Can we pretend we never loved?

00:02:43.021 --> 00:02:46.021
Why did you come to me but not stay with me?

00:02:46.021 --> 00:02:47.854
Why did you leave so quickly?

00:02:48.044 --> 00:02:53.853
You left our place and left me with unexplained questions.
Even though everything has passed, I still feeling pain inside.

00:02:54.228 --> 00:03:02.019
Now I'm trying to stop being stuck in the past though deep in my heart I still holding all the memories of you.

00:03:02.019 --> 00:03:06.851
I know that I still loving you.

00:03:07.851 --> 00:03:11.017
I remember the happy days we had.

00:03:11.017 --> 00:03:14.017
And I also remember the passionate kisses you gave me every day.

00:03:14.225 --> 00:03:20.016
Everything at that moment suddenly fell apart like raindrops outside the window.

00:03:20.224 --> 00:03:27.848
Even though everything between us has faded, I still waiting for you.

00:03:27.848 --> 00:03:33.014
I'm afraid I'm the only one who want us to get back together.

00:03:33.014 --> 00:03:39.555
In the dark I quietly let time pass.

00:03:39.555 --> 00:03:46.013
I know our love has gone.
After everything I feel confused and doubtful about our story.

00:03:46.013 --> 00:03:54.220
The rain outside is still falling at the moment.
Because of the nostalgic rain, I remember that I held you happily in this room.

00:03:54.220 --> 00:04:00.011
The room where all our beautiful memories are kept.

