00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The sunshine will light up hope of those who have wandered every night to find the way out.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The feet keep walking without a break for many days and need saving.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
In my mind I always hope a brighter day with a star lighting up my way.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:48.000
One day I will be brighter than the star.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:51.000
My tear has fallen down and wetted my shoulders. 

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:58.000
Night by night, I wish to see my bright future.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Tomorrow the rain will wash off and give me faith.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.000
Oh life! Please bring me joyful days.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Oh my dear friends! Please come here.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.000
Then follow me and go to the party all night long.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Follow me all night, forget all the worries

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:28.000
and all the feeling of life, let’s go party all night alright.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.000
Follow me all night, night, night

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:38.000
Oh my dear friends! Follow me everywhere because life is so short

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:46.000
Don’t waste your bright life

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:50.000
Follow me, Follow me all night

